{"schema_version":"d_pc_direction_full_review_cover_patch_round2_v1","steam_appid":"4714000","display_title":"1.80战神微变","sources":{"player":{"label":"普通玩家","readable_count":22,"empty_status_count":0,"reviews":[{"id":"p001","recommendation":"推荐","text":"法阵系统升了两级之后切割伤害加了不少，打白怪明显快了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774826463/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p002","recommendation":"推荐","text":"官位系统每天做任务攒功勋升上去，给的属性是永久的，值得慢慢点","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774610619/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p003","recommendation":"推荐","text":"封号系统和转生挂钩，升封号能进更高级地图，目标很清晰","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199889141623/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p004","recommendation":"推荐","text":"装备鉴定系统有点看运气，但鉴出好词条的时候提升很大","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774773466/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p005","recommendation":"推荐","text":"时装礼包给的攻速加成和麻痹效果打架时很实用，不光是外观货","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774973012/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p006","recommendation":"推荐","text":"残阵碎片和灵魂宝石在神器地图和高阶BOSS掉落稳定，后期打造必备","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774748738/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p007","recommendation":"推荐","text":"王者会员给的200万绑定元宝看着多，但强化和鉴定几下就花完了，不过确实顶用","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774852020/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p008","recommendation":"推荐","text":"封号地图里的转生装备掉率比普通图高不少，建议到了等级就进去刷","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198775622355/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p009","recommendation":"推荐","text":"角色外观没有性别限制，选了女性角色配上翅膀和神器光效，走在土城挺显眼","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774570719/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p010","recommendation":"推荐","text":"翅膀系统升了两阶之后加了移速和吸血，跑图和续航都舒服了不少","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774693622/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p011","recommendation":"推荐","text":"十方以上的BOSS血厚攻高，没有石化套和疾速套的话不建议硬扛","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198775429114/recommended/4714000/"},{"id":"p012","recommendation":"推荐","text":"氪